@startuml 11_state_session
title State Model: Session and Match Lifecycle (FR-13, FR-33, FR-34, FR-35)
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description
skinparam state<<planned>> {
  BackgroundColor #EEEEEE
  BorderColor #888888
  FontColor #666666
}

[*] --> Waiting : SessionStore.Create, then first Join

state "Waiting\nSessionStatus WAITING\n(lobby between matches)" as Waiting
state "InProgress\nSessionStatus IN_PROGRESS" as InProgress
state "Closed\nSessionStatus CLOSED" as Closed <<planned>>

Waiting --> Waiting : Join [role has room] / StateUpdate\nLeave / StateUpdate\nSetReady / StateUpdate
Waiting --> InProgress : SetReady [Game.ReadyToStart is true]\n/ NewMatch, StateUpdate to every member
InProgress --> InProgress : Join / ErrorResponse(SESSION_NOT_JOINABLE)\naccepted action / StateUpdate\nrejected action / ErrorResponse, no change
InProgress --> Waiting : Game.Outcome is terminal\n/ MatchResult, history append, Ready flags cleared
Waiting --> Closed : last member leaves or idle limit passes
InProgress --> Closed : abort (server shutdown) or every player gone

Closed --> [*]

@enduml
